Use terminal to run:
1. ffuf -u http://127.0.0.1:5000/FUZZ -w /usr/share/wordlists/dirb/common.txt -mc 
200,301,302,403,404 -t 20 -o /tmp/ffuf_endpoints.json -json
2. If ffuf finds interesting dirs, run a deeper scan on those paths
