routes)
4. curl -s http://127.0.0.1:5000/sitemap.xml - check for sitemap routes

For each discovered endpoint:
- Test with curl to see response codes and brief response
- Note if it requires authentication (401/403 vs 200)
- Record any parameters visible in URLs or forms

Use notes tool to create a note called "endpoint-inventory" containing:
- All discovered endpoints
- HTTP methods that work
- Auth requirement status (public vs protected)
- Any parameters observed
- Any proxy/dispatch endpoints noted
